  "difficulty": "medium",
  "instruction": "Use the Babson–Olin–Wellesley shuttle schedule open in Microsoft Edge. On a weekday, you are at Olin College East Hall at 8:45 am and want the first shuttle that will take you to Wellesley College Campus Center. Create `answer.txt` on the Desktop with four lines: the Olin departure time, the time at Babson College Hollister Parking Lot, the time at Founders Parking Lot Gates, and the arrival time at Wellesley College Campus Center.",
  "source": "https://www.babson.edu/media/babson/assets/isss/AY-2025-2026-BOW-Shuttle-Schedule.pdf",
  "gt_steps": [
    "Read the weekday Babson–Olin–Wellesley shuttle timetable.",
    "Find the first Olin College East Hall departure after 8:45 am: 8:52 am.",
    "Follow the same timetable row to Babson College Hollister Parking Lot at 8:55 am, Founders Parking Lot Gates at 9:05 am, and Wellesley College Campus Center at 9:07 am.",
    "Open Notepad and enter the four requested items, one per line.",
    "Save the file as `answer.txt` on the Desktop."
  ],
  "config": [
